    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "(1))\nEAT.\nDRINK.\nSHOP.\nYour Choice\nA'A\noneworld\nA*A",
      "Welcome aboard. When you fly American, it's all\nabout your choices. We invite you to choose from\nour menu of quality food and beverage selections,\nshop on board with SkyMall, or surf the web on\nWi-Fi equipped flights. It's your choice.\nBREAKFAST CAFÉ\nBreakfast Café Snack Tray - $5.29\nStacy's® Simply Naked™ bagel chips, Rondele® original\nplain cheese spread, Ocean Spray Craisins®, Emerald®\nnatural almonds, Biscoff cookie\nServed on select morning transcontinental and Hawaii flights.\nBreakfast Café Croissant\nSandwich - $6\nRoasted turkey and Cheddar cheese\non breakfast bread.\nServed with\nHellmann's® Dijonnaise™ and Stacy's®\ncinnamon pita chips on the side.\nServed on select morning\ndomestic flights over three hours.\nSNACKS\nCheese-and-Cracker Tray - $4.49\nPepperidge Farm crackers, a cheese slice,\nSun-Maid raisins, Fisher mixed nuts\nFruit and Nut Blend - $4.49\nRaisins, cranberries, banana chips, hazelnuts, cashews, almonds\nLay's Stax - Potato crisps - $3.29*\nMegaBite Cookie - Chocolate chip - $3.29\nServed on domestic flights longer than two hours.\nProducts may vary and may not be available on all flights.\nSUN-MAI\nRAISIN\nSAD\n*Available on flights departing after 10 a.m.\nili(c))\nParmesan\nCaesar\nSALADS\nBOSTON\n- 58-\nBoston Market® Chicken Caesar\nMARKE\nSalad and SUNCHIPS® - $10\nCrisp romaine lettuce topped with all-white-meat\nchicken and Parmesan, Romano and Asiago cheeses.\nServed with creamy Caesar dressing on the side.\nAvailable on Hawaii and transcontinental flights.\nSANDWICHES\nBoston Market®\nChicken Carver\nand Miss Vickie's®\nChips - $10\nAll-white-meat\nchicken, Cheddar\ncheese, leaf lettuce,\nsliced tomato and Dijon\nmayonnaise on an artisan roll.\nBoston Market® Deli Chicken Pesto\nand Miss Vickie's® Chips - $10\nAll-white-meat chicken topped with pesto aioli,\nmesclun greens and tomato on sliced multigrain bread.\nServed with sweet garlic dressing on the side.\nBoston Market® Turkey Carver\nand Miss Vickie's® Chips - $10\nSliced oven-roasted turkey breast, Swiss cheese,\ncreamy Parmesan spread, sliced tomato and\nleaf lettuce on artisan-style bread.\nAvailable on domestic flights longer than three hours.\nOne sandwich variety is offered per flight.\nDomestic flights are those within the U.S., and those between\nthe U.S. and Hawaii, Alaska, Canada, Mexico and select\nCaribbean and Latin America cities.\nCOMPLIMENTARY\nBEVERAGES\nCoca-Cola Classic • Diet Coke • Sprite\nPepsi • Diet Pepsi • Sierra Mist Free\nDr Pepper* • Diet Dr Pepper*\nCanada Dry Ginger Ale\nCanada Dry Tonic Water\nCanada Dry Club Soda\nMinute Maid Orange Juice\nMinute Maid Apple Juice\nMinute Maid Cranberry Apple Cocktail\nMr. \u0026 Mrs. T Bloody Mary Mix\nMott's Tomato Juice\nJava City's 100% Rainforest Alliance Certified™ coffee\nBigelow Tea • Bottled Water • Milk#\nBEER, WINE \u0026 SPIRITS\nWine \u0026 Spirits - $7\nABSOLUT® Vodka\nAmaretto*\nBacardi Light Rum\nBaileys Irish Cream#\nBeefeater Gin\nCanadian Club#\nCourvoisier*\nDewar's White Label\nGlenlivet Single Malt*\nJack Daniel's*\nJim Beam Bourbon*\nKahlúa*\nBeer - $6\nAmstel Light#\nBudweiser*\nCorona Extra*\nHeineken\nMiller*\nProducts may vary and may not be available on all flights.\n* Not available on all flights or in all cabins.\nWe recycle aluminum cans in select U.S. cities.\nThese pages are brought to you courtesy of the following companies:\nPEPSICO\nSNAPPIE\nDR PEPPER\nCoca-Cola\nFor any questions, comments and suggestions, please contact us at\ninflightretail@aa.com.\nFSC\nMIX\nPaper from\nresponsible sources\nFSC® C101537"
    ],
